    <unit id="abb10387-4701-42c2-9e13-280e41fd8408">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 2</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: # </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>NVIDIA Monitor</source>
        <target>英伟达监视器</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="3f26e1cc-fade-4d87-bab2-62359514ac00">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 4</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>This add-on allows you to monitor various parameters of NVIDIA graphics cards, such as name, used memory, free and total memory, power usage, temperature, and more.</source>
        <target>本插件允许您监控英伟达（NVIDIA）显卡的各项参数，例如名称、已用显存、可用显存、总显存、功耗、温度等。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="5eabfbe3-5ec7-46e9-b76c-ce246069ae8a">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 6</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Shortcuts</source>
        <target>快捷键</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="15d19137-50ae-421d-be79-d7f7d849ea92">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Note: Some information parameters may not be compatible or supported depending on the graphics card.</source>
        <target>注意：某些信息参数可能会因显卡型号的不同而不兼容或不受支持。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="e1bed0f6-7e19-4769-9f93-3d98207de900">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 9</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>All the following shortcuts can be customized in the input gestures/NVIDIAMonitor category. Pressing a shortcut twice copies the information to the clipboard.</source>
        <target>以下所有快捷键都可以在“输入手势”中的“英伟达监视器 (NVIDIAMonitor)”类别进行自定义。连续按两次快捷键可将该信息复制到剪贴板。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="8f1eeddc-a1a7-4f96-9a17-b7686d4c3260">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 11</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + alt + g: Announces the GPU name/model.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + alt + g：播报 GPU 名称/型号。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="52cdb5a0-8793-470e-8694-1ad27adee29f">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + alt + u: Announces the GPU UUID.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + alt + u：播报 GPU UUID。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="d1aba7bd-6be2-4819-9dea-3c06646028b5">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 13</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + alt + v: Announces the driver version.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + alt + v：播报驱动程序版本。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="426b20ab-f4ed-4c6a-82f4-ece484d454fc">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 14</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + ctrl + alt + v: Announces the BIOS version.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + ctrl + alt + v：播报 BIOS 版本。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="f4b21a72-82f8-4408-a4f0-4dda884fccc4">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 15</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + alt + 1: Announces the GPU load.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + alt + 1：播报 GPU 负载。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="7a806a73-f8d6-4712-96df-68ddbce9099c">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- NVDA + alt + 2: Announces the memory load.</source>
        <target>- NVDA + alt + 2：播报显存负载。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
