      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 41</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- Fixed a problem with direct pynvml calls.</source>
        <target>- 修复了直接调用 pynvml 出现的问题。</target>
      </segment>
